  "_purpose": "Ranked branch-level operating budget for the /full/ budget panel. Citywide totals, NOT wired to the spatial pipeline \u2014 this answers 'what does the City spend the most on', not 'what does this neighbourhood cost'. Nothing here is imported by src/ or main.py.",
